# Buildroot makeusers table for orion-node.service: add this file to BR2_ROOTFS_USERS_TABLES on
# images whose root filesystem is read-only at runtime (systemd-sysusers cannot add users there).
# Columns: username uid group gid password home shell groups comment (see Buildroot's makeusers).
# Fixed uid/gid 901: every OS image on a board (each product's image and
# slot) shares /data, so the owner of orion-node's state there must not depend
# on which other users an image happens to create first (another product's daemon user is 900).
orion 901 orion 901 * - /bin/false dialout Orion node
